[{"title":"宴杨氏南园并和 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"南亭比似东亭远，三月好花无数开。\n一水绕园如练净，群峰当座送青来。\n清歌屡引蹁跹舞，高兴频流潋滟杯。\n归路斜阳拥车骑，淡云将雨浥轻埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3087,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日馆閤假寐梦澹庵写竹笔势翩翩以求余题觉而有作","author":"杨士奇","text":"日长假寐图书府，梦见挥毫写竹枝。\n三月都无鸿雁信，九霄如睹凤凰仪。\n空怜意惬关飞动，亦拟诗成寄别离。\n淇水湘川渺南北，清风翘首已多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3088,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日馆閤赋柬马学士曹侍讲","author":"杨士奇","text":"九重盛夏净炎氛，停讲经帷已二旬。\n馆閤退朝无一事，衣冠坐论只三人。\n大官致馔循常典，中使传宣锡异珍。\n视草堂前新雨过，锦葵承日不胜春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3089,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画寄远法师","author":"杨士奇","text":"久别山中远法师，春风洒落凤凰枝。\n八窗花雨谭经处，一榻松云入定时。\n出世人高了元法，名家我识惠休诗。\n几时同坐曼陀石，瀹茗焚香慰所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3090,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻远法师新作山居","author":"杨士奇","text":"从知城市厌尘凡，近傍西山草结庵。\n心静故思幽境住，道高不遣俗人参。\n玉泉洗钵时分涧，石匮藏经别在岩。\n檐匐绕林花似雪，飞香常满佛前龛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3091,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答远法师","author":"杨士奇","text":"诗成粲粲素霞开，比似花光月映梅。\n色相已清犹是幻，性根元好不须培。\n堂中明镜常澄澈，天上浮云任去来。\n盛世丛林数耆俊，远公端合斗间魁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3092,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何文渊 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"晓承恩诏出皇京，行李萧萧一叶轻。\n梁柱楩楠希世有，云霄鸿鹄使人惊。\n从来政挟阳和布，况复心涵秋水清。\n共忆江乡今独往，都门分手若为情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3093,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何文渊 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"我重何乡过瑾瑜，清风素节有谁如。\n同乡同志最知己，直道直言多启予。\n圣主方今图致治，长才安得遂閒居。\n到家渐及阳和候，春雁来时应寄书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3094,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和周侍郎大雪赐宴诗","author":"杨士奇","text":"先朝瑞雪兆丰年，一体君臣喜可言。\n已敕大臣颁玉馔，更宣中使出金尊。\n伤心何处攀仙驾，洒泪清诗忆旧恩。\n满目当时肱股在，共摅忠恳答乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3095,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄曾士弘郎中","author":"杨士奇","text":"朝绅归里绝尘事，爱尔廉声达两京。\n萱堂日庆慈闱寿，棘院秋荣令弟名。\n俗辙扫除无一迹，芳醪閒暇尽干觥。\n聊寄一竿淇上绿，更看冰雪岁寒清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3096,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄李学士","author":"杨士奇","text":"别来无日不思君，渺渺燕山望楚云。\n到县几多知识在，入门强半死生分。\n乡闾叙齿应皆让，子舍添丁或未闻。\n冰泮龙河候兰楫，须知同馆重离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3097,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送宗载尚书复任南京吏部","author":"杨士奇","text":"又拜明恩下九霄，騑騑四牡出河桥。\n从知素志怀乡邑，且尽丹诚答圣朝。\n冰雪晓行嗟老大，关山南望向迢遥。\n金陵已熟春前酿，应有梅花候翠鞗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3098,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦觉作","author":"杨士奇","text":"翰苑词林雨露边，不才何幸接时贤。\n故乡迢递六千里，归计蹉跎四十年。\n宝敕恭承明主赐，白头深荷宠恩怜。\n行来夜夜蓬窗梦，只在龙墀玉陛前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3099,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过沛县悼颜伯玮","author":"杨士奇","text":"平生金石见临危，就义从容子亦随。\n千载河山遗迹在，一门忠孝史官知。\n故乡住近文丞相，先德传从鲁太师。\n欲酹丘坟何处是，离离芳草泪空垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3100,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过匡南重悼正安侍讲","author":"杨士奇","text":"玉署联官二十春，超然归去乐閒身。\n醉吟丽句浑忘老，坐对青山不厌贫。\n经年江海鱼书断，落日郊原马鬣新。\n惆怅仰高堂寂寂，寻君不见泪盈巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3101,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅赠显仁刘脩撰","author":"杨士奇","text":"五年不见刘脩撰，长在蓟门劳远思。\n此日归来重晤对，清风潇洒旧襟期。\n香和鼎俎春调膳，影上帘屏夕咏诗。\n别后看梅相忆处，阳和独擅最南枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3102,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹酬颜仲平 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"移植成阴历岁时，虚心劲节几人知。\n临风每听龙吟好，待月常看凤翥迟。\n嘉客频游蒋诩径，高情閒咏武公诗。\n何时君子堂中坐，共看扶疏霁景熙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3103,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹酬颜仲平 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"五十年前握手时，清怀雅度两相知。\n衡茅昨枉过临重，风雨深惭出迓迟。\n剡曲子猷俄反棹，市南摩诘更留诗。\n高山素仰陈夫子，冰玉于今见缉熙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3104,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与鹓稷别","author":"杨士奇","text":"落日萧萧江上寒，临江对酒不成欢。\n君臣义重惭违久，父子情深欲别难。\n春水白鸥閒泛泛，烟皋芳草绿漫漫。\n客程渐与乡关远，回首天南何处看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3105,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽欧阳洙父","author":"杨士奇","text":"家住烟霞蜀洲曲，苍苍乔木百年馀。\n读书行义承先世，流水青山护隐居。\n荣养已沾乌府禄，褒恩曾锡锦绫书。\n浮生何必登耆耋，谁有铭文载令誉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3106,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗侍郎挽诗","author":"杨士奇","text":"金鱼洲北相过日，玉峡楼前执别时。\n匆促共嗟情不尽，幽冥遽恨见无期。\n尚存简册书成绩，不断轺车赋载驰。\n最是边西来往数，至今遗爱后人思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3107,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘不息","author":"杨士奇","text":"两京相见屡经年，束发为儒到白颠。\n恩命晓颁双阙下，帝乡南望五云边。\n夹河杨柳含清雾，新水凫鹥发画船。\n好及明时展材用，临岐为诵鲁駉篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3108,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送曾振新除潜江簿","author":"杨士奇","text":"两家白下东西郭，尔叔童年日往还。\n进士怜渠继乡榜，除官复此出贤关。\n淮南晓棹沙边月，江上晴看雨后山。\n荣捧恩书行素志，莫将离思动愁颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3109,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送道亨王侍郎致政还乡 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"平生操节比琼瑶，身荷天恩到五朝。\n为国一心常耿耿，历官双鬓已萧萧。\n西人每见谈仁政，故吏频闻诵教条。\n独恨相逢各迟暮，白驹那复永今朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3110,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送道亨王侍郎致政还乡 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"萧散高情早息机，衣冠祖送出都畿。\n六官守道如公少，七帙辞荣自古稀。\n沃野秋风黄黍熟，长河春水白鱼肥。\n不才苦被樊笼系，翘首冥鸿叹愿违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3111,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东郭草堂宴集","author":"杨士奇","text":"帝城南畔寻韦曲，浩荡风光三月中。\n衢路尘埃过雨净，林园花树竞春红。\n主人置酒兴非浅，众客题诗欢不穷。\n一杯一曲日西下，莫待银蟾生海东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3112,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽竹轩刘嘉会先生","author":"杨士奇","text":"閒占云霞隐鹿门，一朝厌世隔嚣喧。\n儒林共惜斯文丧，乡邑谁知古道惇。\n雕鹗登庸誇令子，文章为县见贤孙。\n何时归到螺川上，为泻椒浆奠一尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3113,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送廖教谕自谦之任沅江","author":"杨士奇","text":"平生孝友江乡重，一别蹉跎二十年。\n紫诰新求盘谷里，乌纱远上洞庭船。\n秋风粳稻家家熟，楚水鳊鱼处处鲜。\n想见斋居倚脩竹，弦歌长满绿云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3114,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周崇式贰尹赴东莞","author":"杨士奇","text":"河梁秋叶堕萧萧，送客之官道路遥。\n淮上月明潮正满，岭南霜下瘴全消。\n从知苦学持先志，会有忠谟达圣朝。\n邑宰于今望贤佐，过家少驻木兰桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3115,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠本深还吉安","author":"杨士奇","text":"宴罢琼林酒一杯，鞭催五马出蓬莱。\n金章紫绶恩重拜，皂盖朱幡喜复来。\n带得一天新雨露，扫除九邑旧尘埃。\n螺川城外人千亿，争看神明太守回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3116,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公安王氏慈寿堂","author":"杨士奇","text":"堂中寿母八十馀，慈颜和悦身安健。\n俯看兰桂春绕膝，坐听诗书喜生面。\n慈竹阴浓云密垂，谖草花齐锦相炫。\n地近菊潭泉可酿，门倚荆江鱼足馔。\n甘味时邀邻媪同，轻轩晴涉家园遍。\n玉堂禄养共所荣，锦诰恩封会当看。\n耆耋争看人瑞好，康宁本自皇极建。\n中天南极一星明，岁岁长年照华宴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3117,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽赵尚书","author":"杨士奇","text":"五朝遗老今无几，卓荦高才不可羁。\n钦恤晚承虞帝命，旬宣早出缙云司。\n中台优秩升圻父，三礼清心慕伯夷。\n屡挟地仙穷眺览，更携田畯看耘耔。\n甘从白首辞官去，曾以丹衷结主知。\n竹簟茅檐真散逸，药畦花径足栖迟。\n过从每忆频开酝，朝退兼怀共论诗。\n一别三年遂终古，无由持绋送灵輀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3118,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜梦与故冕庵胡公泛舟自鸥江至鹭洲对酒联诗公起首句余续第二第三句公续第四第五句余复续第六第七句公结末句既觉而忘第五至第七三句怆然怀旧因补之如左","author":"杨士奇","text":"金螺潇洒对芙蓉，鹭渚鱼洲窈窕通。\n远树白云秋色净，故人清兴酒船同。\n河山梦冷讴吟后，生死交深感慨中。\n犹想胜缘如夙昔，并骑黄鹄过江东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3119,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳阳楼","author":"杨士奇","text":"城上岳阳楼，高临洞庭水。\n君山望不迷，日日风波里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3120,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻蔡冑不见","author":"杨士奇","text":"空复出城来，问君还城去。\n寂寂掩双扉，忆君情不叙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3121,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"残寺","author":"杨士奇","text":"残寺连农舍，空窗露佛灯。\n四围无古木，那解隐高僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3122,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示鹓兄弟 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"身戴君亲德，何能一粟酬。\n蹉跎今白首，行迈尚悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3123,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示鹓兄弟 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"饭牛先垄下，夙志未消磨。\n恩重身难去，非关恋玉珂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3124,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示鹓兄弟 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"二老东西郭，风期晚益亲。\n将车数来往，遥忆似荀陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3125,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示鹓兄弟 其四","author":"杨士奇","text":"待制传宗嫡，元孙见可人。\n承家在好德，切莫厌清贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3126,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示鹓兄弟 其五","author":"杨士奇","text":"爱身如白玉，为学趁青春。\n须识潜鱼跃，还思屈蠖伸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3127,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"杨士奇","text":"海天秋似洗，渺渺净烟涛。\n忽露珊瑚树，还看翡翠毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3128,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹与妻弟郭志善","author":"杨士奇","text":"溪上娟娟竹，年深百尺馀。\n何时过溪上，折竿钓溪鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3129,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清夜","author":"杨士奇","text":"清夜坐庭阶，薰风拂杨柳。\n仰首望天河，微云翳南斗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3130,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"老树不为材，新林郁苍翠。\n矫首瞻西山，朝来有爽气。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3131,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"溪上带清峰，溪边满芳树。\n谁傍白云居，犹轸青云慕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3132,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄友 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"昔在词林日，同看翠玉枝。\n好风清不断，曾结岁寒期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3133,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄友 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"霜节亭亭直，凌云发采章。\n春风和煦日，亲见凤鸣阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3134,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄友 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"平安常有报，径造岂无期。\n万里相思意，为欹淇澳诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3135,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"杨士奇","text":"士有不遇时，放浪遗世情。\n彼哉七君子，亦未泊其情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3136,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘英竹 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"高崖入烟雾，下有清泠渊。\n青鸾云中来，照影故蹁跹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3137,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘英竹 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"湘灵动云根，散作霏霏雨。\n湿重翡翠毛，凉浸珊瑚树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3138,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹赠钟子勤太守","author":"杨士奇","text":"葳蕤凤凰羽，白日动毵毵。\n临别遥相赠，清风五岭南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3139,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题槎翁画龙 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"天下文明日，云从隘九霄。\n归田沾霈泽，同幸际皇朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3140,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题槎翁画龙 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"往岁尚书履，排云到九关。\n归来石台下，犹记写龙颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3141,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金侍讲所藏赵仲穆画马 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"粲烂五花骢，轩昂八尺龙。\n惟应天厩里，得似画图中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3142,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金侍讲所藏赵仲穆画马 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"晓日立彤墀，光辉玉仗齐。\n朝回长散诞，流水绿杨堤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3143,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金侍讲所藏赵仲穆画马 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"养育天闲久，常怀万里心。\n太平无用武，自愧主恩深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3144,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到桃源黄学士舟已先在南岸不得相即相望怅然","author":"杨士奇","text":"隔水不得语，中肠千万回。\n知公望我至，如我望公来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3145,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清河县调公素","author":"杨士奇","text":"暮出清江闸，夜投清河口。\n明日到桃源，谁家问沽酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3146,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夹沟","author":"杨士奇","text":"晴日烘绵花，暄风吹豆荚。\n九月似春天，河边见飞蝶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3147,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"离砖河驿十里阻风","author":"杨士奇","text":"白浪高如屋，停舟日已中。\n长芦望不到，愁杀石尤风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3148,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行营凿井得泉","author":"杨士奇","text":"凿井得泉水，清泠碧照人。\n铜瓶罢远汲，稍解仆夫勤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3149,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙城","author":"杨士奇","text":"昔岁城中过，曾遇江南叟。\n身老意萧閒，宁知今在否。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3150,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"始乘马","author":"杨士奇","text":"岁馀不乘马，今朝还据鞍。\n眼昏身力弱，心怯道途难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3151,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望鸡鸣山","author":"杨士奇","text":"鸡鸣山下路，危险曾经涉。\n今日望鸡鸣，未度心先怯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3152,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度鸡鸣山马上口号与同行者","author":"杨士奇","text":"蜀道天下险，王尊叱其御。\n何况鸡鸣道，今随六龙度。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3153,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨晴","author":"杨士奇","text":"东方明月上，雨止风亦罢。\n仰荷苍天仁，俯恻行路者。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3154,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡河","author":"杨士奇","text":"骑马渡河水，马渴未即渡。\n饮足不须鞭，腾踏长嘶去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3155,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问唐孟高需枸杞","author":"杨士奇","text":"与卿俱七十，卿有好颜容。\n此后诗相寄，须兼枸杞封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3156,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自新河迤南道傍官宇铺舍皆一新知是府尹李庸所作赋 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"道途广且平，亭馆皆辉焕。\n追忆旧行时，惊喜还嗟叹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3157,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自新河迤南道傍官宇铺舍皆一新知是府尹李庸所作赋 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"府尹才能好，经营次第新。\n相知已心熟，犹问路傍人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3158,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]